  "bodyHash": "D5swVrLt6TE=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">裝甲重量並非新增武器或物品，而是添加了一項全新機制。現在盔甲有了重量！不幸（或幸運）的是，它不會降低你的速度，而是會影響重力！你的盔甲越強（盔甲值越高），跳躍時的速度就會受到影響</strong></p><p>我是法國人，這個模組是用 Mcreator 製作的（如果英文有誤請見諒 😅）&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你的盔甲值越高，跳躍的高度就越低（在原版中，獄髓盔甲是最重的）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rjnw3ws.gif\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個模組新增了一個新機制，你現在可以砸向敵人對他們造成傷害</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PgCDZgL.gif\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為了增強這個效果，你可以用「猛砸」附魔（最高可達 III 級）為你的靴子附魔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cw5H32I.gif\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">之後，如果你厭倦了比平常跳得更低，你可以為你的其中一件盔甲附上「輕盈」附魔，回歸原版遊戲體驗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:12px\">你可以將裝甲重量放入你的模組包中！</span></pre><pre>&nbsp;</pre><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以來看看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a hre